### ==========================================================
### 商品管理 + 共享池
### 先保证 {{token}} 在 env 中有效
### 先用 #1 查列表拿组合ID
### ==========================================================

### ——— 商品管理 ———

### 1. 商品列表（含组合库存）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 新增商品（带属性组合，categoryId 从分类接口获取）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "连衣裙",
  "categoryId": 21,
  "purchasePrice": 80.00,
  "sellingPrice": 150.00,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "combinations": [
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"红色\",\"尺码\":\"M\"}", "stock": 15 },
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"红色\",\"尺码\":\"L\"}", "stock": 10 },
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"白色\",\"尺码\":\"M\"}", "stock": 12 }
  ]
}

### 3. 新增商品（无属性）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "纽扣",
  "categoryId": 25,
  "purchasePrice": 1.00,
  "sellingPrice": 2.00,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "combinations": [
    { "attrsJson": "{}", "stock": 100 }
  ]
}

### 4. 按分类筛选
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?categoryId=21
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 按名称搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?keyword=纽扣
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 编辑商品（id 替换为实际值）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "新款连衣裙",
  "categoryId": 21,
  "purchasePrice": 75.00,
  "sellingPrice": 169.00,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "combinations": [
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"红色\",\"尺码\":\"M\"}", "stock": 20 },
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"红色\",\"尺码\":\"L\"}", "stock": 8 }
  ]
}

### 7. 删除商品（有库存会报错）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ——— 共享池（切换批发商 token 后测试） ———

### 8. 批发商：新增商品
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "男士衬衫",
  "categoryId": 23,
  "purchasePrice": 60.00,
  "sellingPrice": 120.00,
  "imageUrl": "",
  "combinations": [
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"白色\",\"尺码\":\"L\"}", "stock": 50 },
    { "attrsJson": "{\"颜色\":\"蓝色\",\"尺码\":\"XL\"}", "stock": 30 }
  ]
}

### 9. 批发商：加入共享池
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shared-products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "sharedPrice": 100.00
}

### 10. 查看共享池列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shared-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 批发商：取消共享
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/shared-products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
